# NOTE: its old terraform/ deploy tooling used to be gitignored here too
# (terraform/main.tf, outputs.tf, variables.tf, user_data.yaml) - removed
# once the new terraform/ setup (prod ETL infra) started reusing those
# same conventional filenames and got silently dropped by `git add
# terraform/` with no warning. If a *.tf file ever mysteriously won't
# stage, check here first.
